 "message": "wc_bridge: the trusted anchor is the enrollment's identity, not its root\n\nA versioned, domain-separated digest of the root, the manifest digest,\nthe geometry, the claim set's ordered row layout and the padding rule,\nencoded identically in Python and Rust (shared vectors). A proof that\nmoves the boundary between weights and masks under the same root names\nanother identity. The q_w floor and the dense-weight anchor are\nunchanged; the resident and streaming builds share one manifest digest.",
